speechtext:
The minister on Friday last said that;
Bridges are now being built across the river, or it is intended to build them.
Who is intending to build them ?

(Translation.) That
may be correct, but there are other items further on in this blue-book, which include the service? I have just mentioned. Why not prepare those Estimates so that they 326}
